// Default mount target for the agent-only case - no components.
// docker-compose.yml mounts ./config/alloy/${COMPOSE_PROFILES:-empty}.alloy
// as the second file in Alloy's config directory; this is what gets picked
// when COMPOSE_PROFILES is unset (every agent-only host), so the syslog
// receiver in full.alloy simply isn't loaded there. Intentionally empty,
// not deleted - the mount needs a real file to point at either way.
